# Files excluded from the archive uploaded to EAS Build.
#
# WHY THIS EXISTS: without it the archive was 1.0 GB, because android/app/build
# alone is 2.5 GB of local Gradle output — the debug APK, the release AAB, the
# CMake object tree and the native symbol files. EAS builds from source and
# regenerates all of it, so every byte of that upload was wasted on a slow
# transfer and quota.
#
# .easignore REPLACES .gitignore for build uploads rather than extending it, so
# anything that should not be uploaded has to be listed here even if git
# already ignores it.

# ── Local build output ───────────────────────────────────────
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/.gradle/
android/.cxx/
android/app/.cxx/
modules/*/android/build/
modules/*/android/.cxx/
ios/build/
ios/Pods/
ios/DerivedData/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa

# ── Caches and local state ───────────────────────────────────
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
node_modules/
.gradle/

# ── Not needed by a build ────────────────────────────────────
# The public marketing site, the Play Store assets, and the changelog are
# deliverables rather than build inputs.
docs/
store/
Drift-changelog.xlsx

# ── VCS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
